   "id": 639653,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Place the following events in their sequential order:\n<ol>\n<li>protein kinase A is activated</li>\n<li>glycogen breakdown</li>\n<li>epinephrine binds to G-protein-linked receptor</li>\n<li>G-protein activates adenylyl cyclase</li>\n<li>GTP is exchanged for GDP on the G-protein</li>\n<li>ATP is converted to cAMP</li>\n</ol>",
